                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As typical as it is for the man who created this game, it hasn't been updated in almost a decade and most probably never will be. The man who created these games is a very close-minded and arrogant individual and these games will most likely sit and rot on this platform as another early access game never to be played again. It's like watching someone paint the Mona Lisa of video games, something so unique and sparkling like gold, then he proceeds to hit it with a sledgehammer and walks away as it sits in the dust with cockroaches occasionally walking over it.\n\nIf only he saw the potential.",
